      534.32,
      295.41,
      592.4
    ],
    "text": "The following allotment of land situated in the GramaNiladari Division of village of 730\"B\" Katukurunda inDivisional Secretary's division of Kalutara in the district ofKalutara in Western province and marked in Surveyor General'splan No. P.P.K. 4688.",
