    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 02Name of Land: Usliyanage Watta, Usliyanage Maha Watta,Madangahawatta; Description: Garden, Permanant Buildingand cement Well; Claiments: Government; Previous Claimant:Sadik Marikkar Hasan Marikkar and others, \"Riwer side\"Dhargha Town, Aluthgama; Extent: 0.8790 Hectare.",
